      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 검은 머리, 검은 후드, 특이하게 생긴 큰 검… ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "黒髪に黒のフード、変わった形の大きな剣…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 6,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "흐흥, 틀림없네요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ふむ、間違いありません！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkAppend": true
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 확인차 여쭤보겠습니다, 혹시 구원단의 여정 단장님 되실까요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "念のためにお伺いしますが、救援団の団長でしょうか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "응, 맞아.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "うん、そうだよ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "EmotionEffect": "FUN",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 안녕하세요! 진심을 담은 배송, 배달부 베라입니다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "こんにちは！真心を運ぶ宅急便、配達屋のベラです！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 단장님 앞으로 편지가 왔어요. 등기우편에 직접 수령 필이고, 발신자는...",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "団長宛てにお手紙が届いています。本人限定受取の書留で、差出人は…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 세상에, 관측사 평의회에서 보냈네요?!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "わぁ！<r=ポラリス>観測士評議会</r>ですね！？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 이렇게 높은 분들에게 편지를 받다니, 대단하신 분인가봐요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "こんなに偉い方からお手紙が届くなんて、団長はすごい方なんですね！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "그, 그 정도는 아닌데…",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "そ、それほどでもないよ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 앗, 저도 참, 괜히 바쁘신 분을 붙잡고 있었네요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あっ、お忙しいのに引き留めてしまいましたね。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 여기 서명 한 번만 부탁드립니다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "こちらにサインをお願いします！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_LPU_POST",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": " 감사합니다, 오늘도 좋은 하루 보내세요! 진심을 담은 배송, 배달부 베라였습니다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ありがとうございます！それでは、いい一日を～！真心を運ぶ宅急便、配達屋のベラでした！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_LPU_POST_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "고마워, 고생해.",
